{
 "duration": 25.017,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Lena enters Glacier on a quarter tank, planning to fill up later.",
   "start": 0.5,
   "end": 4.325
  },
  {
   "text": "There's no gas station anywhere inside the park.",
   "start": 4.825,
   "end": 7.465
  },
  {
   "text": "And on the east side, each valley is its own dead end, so close on the map can mean an hour in the car.",
   "start": 7.965,
   "end": 14.17
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 14.77,
   "end": 15.697
  },
  {
   "text": "Fill up in town before you enter,",
   "start": 16.097,
   "end": 17.887
  },
  {
   "text": "and plan the day by drive times, not by the map.",
   "start": 18.137,
   "end": 20.819
  },
  {
   "text": "Lena tops up first.",
   "start": 21.419,
   "end": 22.746
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before Glacier.",
   "start": 23.346,
   "end": 24.817
  }
 ],
